url] (part of [l=Bertelsmann AG]), which was completed on August 5, 2004. It was one of the four major labels.\r\nIn August 2008, Sony acquired Bertelsmann's 50% stake in the company. The new company reverted back to its old name, [l=Sony Music Entertainment], on January 1, 2009.\r\n\r\nExcept for occasional reissues and represses with no update of artwork and/or copyright notice (eg. [r23789729], [r14539910]), Sony BMG Music Entertainment won't be credited on 2009 or later releases.\r\n\r\n[b]CD matrix information:[/b]\r\n\r\nSome CDs may show the [i]Sony BMG Music Entertainment[/i] logo with the following matrix style: \r\n[Sony BMG Music Entertainment logo] 5xxxxxxx/YYY ZZ\r\nwhere:\r\n- 5xxxxxxx is a number assigned by the plant for internal cataloguing (see below for the plants). \r\n- YYY is the catalogue number of the release.\r\n- ZZ is a two digit number, often 21 or 22, 25 and 26 are also known. \r\nUsually in conjunction with Mould SID Code IFPI 07** or IFPI RV**. \r\n\r\nThese CDs are actually manufactured on behalf of [i]Sony BMG Music Entertainment[/i] by the pressing plant known variously as:\r\n[l=Sonopress Arvato] (2004-2008)\r\n[l=Arvato Digital Services] (2008-2011)\r\n(see Arvato / Sonopress profiles for additional details)\r\n\r\n[i]Sony BMG Music Entertainment[/i] should not be credited with [i]Glass Mastered At[/i] or [i]Pressed By[/i] on such CDs. Please credit the appropriate pressing plant based on the release date of the specific CD.","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:label:53569","relations":{"parentLabel":null,"sublabels":[{"id":1676259,"name":"2CD Albums Originaux"},{"id":3765151,"name":"2CD's"},{"id":1874426,"name":"Album Of The Month"},{"id":2675702,"name":"Best Of The"},{"id":1084546,"name":"CD+DVD"},{"id":1055158,"name":"CMG (3)"},{"id":1674811,"name":"Coffret Holographique"},{"id":428385,"name":"Collections"},{"id":1042383,"name":"Columbia Jazz Profiles"},{"id":645815,"name":"Custom Marketing Group"},{"id":799029,"name":"Dance Va